Package: WMskelstats
Title: White Matter Analysis with Tract-Based Spatial Statistics
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2026-10-12
Authors@R: c(
    person("Junhong", "Yu", , "junhong.yu@ntu.edu.sg", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2563-9658")),
    person("Charly H. A.", "Billaud", , "charly.billaud@ntu.edu.sg", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-3466-9963"))
  )
Maintainer: Charly Billaud <charly.billaud@ntu.edu.sg>
Description: Automatic extraction of white matter skeletons from QSIprep (Cieslak et al. (2021) <doi:10.1038/s41592-021-01185-5>) and QSIrecon (Cieslak et al. (2022) <doi:10.5281/zenodo.16903077>) output directories, with Tract-Based Spatial Statistics (TBSS, Smith et al. (2006) <doi:10.1016/j.neuroimage.2006.02.024>) and plotters. The package works with the aforementioned software's applicable metrics (such as metrics from diffusion tensor imaging, diffusion kurtosis imaging, Neurite Orientation Dispersion and Density Imaging). 
